  "subQuests": [
    {
      "subId": "7224001",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to the afterimage",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "722400101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "722400101": {
            "id": "722400101",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "???",
            "text": "Oh ho, are you here to try my latest, greatest work, too?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722400102"
            ]
          },
          "722400102": {
            "id": "722400102",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "What are you, Enkanomiya's celebrity chef?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722400103"
            ]
          },
          "722400103": {
            "id": "722400103",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Date",
            "text": "The name's Date. They used to call me Daedalus, son of Eurydates. I'm a labyrinth artisan! The puzzle you just went through is my work.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722400104"
            ]
          },
          "722400104": {
            "id": "722400104",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Oh, so you're the guy who had fun stumping us, huh? Alright! Bye!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722400105"
            ]
          },
          "722400105": {
            "id": "722400105",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Date",
            "text": "Hey, wait, wait a moment! I'm not just some kid doodling on pieces of paper. I'm no mere labyrinth artisan either — I'm the second-best architect in the history of Byakuyakoku!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722400106"
            ]
          },
          "722400106": {
            "id": "722400106",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "And who's number one?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722400107"
            ]
          },
          "722400107": {
            "id": "722400107",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Date",
            "text": "Why, Aberaku no Mikoto, of course, bless his heart! If the Dainichi Mikoshi were to be second place, no other building could take first place.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722400108"
            ]
          },
          "722400108": {
            "id": "722400108",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Date",
            "text": "The fact that you've met me means that you've cleared my first \"Neopathos\"-style labyrinth.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722400109"
            ]
          },
          "722400109": {
            "id": "722400109",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Date",
            "text": "How did you find it? Any interest in trying my other \"Heterodoxa\"-style labyrinth? It's completely different from one made only from walls.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722400110"
            ]
          },
          "722400110": {
            "id": "722400110",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "No need. We've sampled your work enough as-is.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722400111"
            ]
          },
          "722400111": {
            "id": "722400111",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Date",
            "text": "Oh, come on now. This masterpiece was a result of abundant space, time, and funds!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722400112"
            ]
          },
          "722400112": {
            "id": "722400112",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Date",
            "text": "A significant portion of us have already gone to live on Watatsumi Island up there on the surface, so there's plenty of real estate around here.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722400113"
            ]
          },
          "722400113": {
            "id": "722400113",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Date",
            "text": "And that's why I borrowed \"Hydrological Studies in Byakuyakoku.\" I meant to study the principles of load-bearing, the maximization of underground spaces, the avoidance of water leakage, and even some principles of geomancy!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722400114"
            ]
          },
          "722400114": {
            "id": "722400114",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Date",
            "text": "Well, and sorry, Ema, but I... might have left the book in the labyrinth's treasure vault...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722400115"
            ]
          },
          "722400115": {
            "id": "722400115",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Sorry, what were you muttering about?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722400116"
            ]
          },
          "722400116": {
            "id": "722400116",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Date",
            "text": "Nothing! I mean to cordially invite you to challenge my grand masterpiece!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722400129"
            ]
          },
          "722400129": {
            "id": "722400129",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Date",
            "text": "Whatever the case may be, take this key. It can be used to open the puzzles.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722400117"
            ]
          },
          "722400117": {
            "id": "722400117",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Date",
            "text": "If you are successful, you can even obtain a medal of recognition that I made myself.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722400118"
            ]
          },
          "722400118": {
            "id": "722400118",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "That's not a very rare prize.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722400119"
            ]
          },
          "722400119": {
            "id": "722400119",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Date",
            "text": "I have also hidden my treasures in the vault ahead. If you obtain two medals, you can open the treasury!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722400120"
            ]
          },
          "722400120": {
            "id": "722400120",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Oh... is that how it is? Well, we'll give it a try if we have time, then.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722400121"
            ]
          },
          "722400121": {
            "id": "722400121",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Date",
            "text": "Wonderful! I look forward to your feedback.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722400122"
            ]
          },
          "722400122": {
            "id": "722400122",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Date",
            "text": "Ah, yes! Since you've conquered the first labyrinth, here's your first medal.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722400123"
            ]
          },
          "722400123": {
            "id": "722400123",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Oh, okay...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722400124"
            ]
          },
          "722400124": {
            "id": "722400124",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Date",
            "text": "So, any comments?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722400125"
            ]
          },
          "722400125": {
            "id": "722400125",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "How should we put it? It felt like...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722400126"
            ]
          },
          "722400126": {
            "id": "722400126",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Date",
            "text": "Felt like?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722400127"
            ]
          },
          "722400127": {
            "id": "722400127",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "It felt like it lacked a little boom-shaka-laka.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722400128"
            ]
          },
          "722400128": {
            "id": "722400128",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Date",
            "text": "Boom-shaka-laka? What's that?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7224002",
      "subQuestName": "Obtain Date's other Medal of Recognition",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "722400201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "722400201": {
            "id": "722400201",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Date",
            "text": "Did you clear the labyrinth over there as well? Good, very good. Very impressive.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722400202"
            ]
          },
          "722400202": {
            "id": "722400202",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Oh, okay...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722400203"
            ]
          },
          "722400203": {
            "id": "722400203",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Date",
            "text": "What did you think of it?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722400204"
            ]
          },
          "722400204": {
            "id": "722400204",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "What we think? Well...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722400205"
            ]
          },
          "722400205": {
            "id": "722400205",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Date",
            "text": "Hehe, it was super intricate and super awesome, wasn't it?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722400206"
            ]
          },
          "722400206": {
            "id": "722400206",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Heh... Hehe!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722400207"
            ]
          },
          "722400207": {
            "id": "722400207",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Date",
            "text": "What do you mean, \"hehe\"!?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722400208"
            ]
          },
          "722400208": {
            "id": "722400208",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Date",
            "text": "*cough* Regardless, since you now have both medals of recognition, the path to the secret chamber should now be open.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722400209"
            ]
          },
          "722400209": {
            "id": "722400209",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Date",
            "text": "Place the medals in there, and you should be able to open the treasury gate."
          }
        }
      }
    },
